@DrJasonJohnson The meat behind #DefundThePolice is fine - but the BRANDING, in some districts, *IS* as bad as the blue dogs say, FOR THEM.

And in a world as gerrymandered as Repubs have made it, Dems MUST win in those blue dog areas too.

So… why did #BlackLivesMatter work as a slogan?…

@DrJasonJohnson Because #BlackLivesMatter, on its own, offends no one AND begs - no, DEMANDS - a question, which leads to a discussion.

#DefundThePolice does neither.

And yes, I get the Farther Left *insists* they compromised on that slogan. But that's not the point…

@theandrewkclark @AnandWrites @harrisonjaime #BlackLivesMatter worked.
#DefundThePolice didn't work the same way.
